    {
      "claim": "Sub-20% F records in unrelated scaffolds/species (mouse venlafaxine 11.6%, rat sulpiride 15%, dog tramadol SR 10%; C32, C34, C43) are not transferable to the query and do not provide affirmative low-F evidence for it.",
      "card_ids": ["C32", "C34", "C43"]
    },
    {
